{"title": "Typhoon Dujuan approaches Japan, causing flight cancellations and warnings", "summary": "Typhoon Dujuan is approaching Japan's east coast, prompting flood and landslide warnings. Hundreds of flights have been cancelled, and evacuations have been urged. Linear rain bands could form over Kanto and central Japan. The typhoon has already disrupted transportation and led to the closure of tourist hotspots. The equestrian eventing competition at the Asian Games in Aichi Prefecture was postponed until Tuesday due to the approaching storm. Dujuan had briefly reached typhoon status on Friday before weakening.", "summary_points": [], "title_hi": "तूफान डुजान जापान के करीब पहुंचा, उड़ानों में देरी और चेतावनियां जारी", "summary_hi": "तूफान डुजान जापान के पूर्वी तट के करीब पहुंच रहा है, जिससे बाढ़ और भूस्खलन की चेतावनी जारी की गई है। सैकड़ों उड़ानें रद्द कर दी गई हैं, और निकासी का आग्रह किया गया है। कांटो और मध्य जापान में रैखिक वर्षा बैंड बन सकते हैं। तूफान ने पहले ही परिवहन को बाधित कर दिया है और पर्यटक स्थलों को बंद करने के लिए मजबूर कर दिया है। ऐची प्रान्त में एशियाई खेलों में घुड़सवारी की प्रतियोगिता को आसन्न तूफान के कारण मंगलवार तक के लिए स्थगित कर दिया गया था। डुजान शुक्रवार को संक्षिप्त रूप से तूफान की स्थिति में पहुंच गया था, इससे पहले कि वह कमजोर हो गया।", "summary_points_hi": [], "framing": {"left": ["The sole rated outlet in this tier highlighted the postponement of the Asian Games equestrian eventing competition."], "center": ["Coverage emphasized the widespread cancellation of hundreds of flights and the approaching storm's impact on travel.", "Reports highlighted official warnings of potential linear rain bands over Kanto and central Japan."]}, "framing_hi": {"left": ["इस श्रेणी में एकमात्र रेटेड आउटलेट ने एशियाई खेलों की घुड़सवारी प्रतियोगिता के स्थगन पर प्रकाश डाला।"], "center": ["कवरेज में सैकड़ों उड़ानों के व्यापक रद्दीकरण और यात्रा पर आसन्न तूफान के प्रभाव पर जोर दिया गया।", "रिपोर्टों में कांटो और मध्य जापान पर संभावित रैखिक वर्षा बैंड की आधिकारिक चेतावनियों को उजागर किया गया।"]}, "topic": "Environment", "region": "World", "published_at": null, "image_url": "https://th-i.thgim.com/public/incoming/jbur6w/article71489995.ece/alternates/LANDSCAPE_1200/2018-08-08T082204Z_350208293_RC11467884C0_RTRMADP_3_ASIA-STORM-JAPAN.JPG", "sources": [{"source": "The Hindu", "owner": "The Hindu Group", "lean": "left", "language": "en", "url": "https://www.thehindu.com/news/international/typhoon-approaches-eastern-japan-prompting-flood-and-landslide-warnings/article71489961.ece", "headline": "Typhoon approaches eastern Japan, prompting flood and landslide warnings"}, {"source": "NDTV", "owner": "NDTV", "lean": "center", "language": "en", "url": "https://www.ndtv.com/world-news/flood-landslide-warnings-in-japan-as-typhoon-dujuan-approaches-east-coast-12075114", "headline": "Flood, Landslide Warnings In Japan As Typhoon Dujuan Approaches East Coast"}, {"source": "The Guardian", "owner": "The Guardian", "lean": "left", "language": "en", "url": "https://www.theguardian.com/environment/2026/sep/21/weather-tracker-japan-typhoon-dujuan", "headline": "Weather tracker: Japanese islands brace for Dujuan to become a typhoon again"}, {"source": "Deutsche Welle", "owner": "Deutsche Welle", "lean": "center", "language": "en", "url": "https://news.google.?oc=5", "headline": "Japan: Typhoon Dujuan sparks flood, landslide warnings"}, {"source": "France 24", "owner": "France 24", "lean": "center", "language": "en", "url": "https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisAFBVV95cUxPczlsYUFZekNTZy1COFh1VmhSeDc0ZnppMEY3YUJlR0JwTmZ2SFhmVUEwc1BVblc1aVRuc1N0c2diaElmdGp1QV9IdEtDRjY0aFQ2RzJJbWlyX2xGR1NsQlpfWGNCbEhtSG83TDZQQ0s0d3NoRnJLR0kyVG0tYlRFQ2F2aEloOC1Dd2FacVprNVJ5REdySmZCbmowYWk3dHFOQ2wxWUdQTDFJZHdZV3YwZw?oc=5", "headline": "Flights scrapped, evacuations urged as Typhoon Dujuan nears Japan"}, {"source": "The Economic Times", "owner": "Times Group", "lean": "center", "language": "en", "url": "https://news.google.?oc=5", "headline": "Hundreds of flights